%
( X VERNIER POSITIONING TEST  -  AIR ONLY, MOVES X ONLY, SPINDLE OFF           )
( docs/handoffs/2026-11-10-x-vernier-commissioning.md, steps 2 and 5            )
( Start capture.sh 200 OUT.txt first, then run this. About 3 minutes.           )
( Twelve target diameters with odd last digits, each reached three ways:        )
(   feed up from .050 below, feed down from .050 above, rapid from .300 away;   )
( a 3 s dwell at each. analyze_holds.py reports the parking error per hold.     )
( Set XD so there is 0.7 dia of clear travel above it.                          )
#<xd> = 2.0000
N10 G20 G7 G18 G90 G94 G40 G49 G80
N20 M5
N30 G00 X[#<xd> + 0.1]
#<k> = 0
o100 while [#<k> LT 12]
  ( targets spread over .33 dia with sub-count fractions: XD + .1 + .02753 k )
  #<t> = [#<xd> + 0.1000 + 0.02753 * #<k>]
  G00 X[#<t> - 0.050]
  G01 X[#<t>] F2.0
  G04 P3.0
  G00 X[#<t> + 0.050]
  G01 X[#<t>] F2.0
  G04 P3.0
  G00 X[#<t> + 0.300]
  G00 X[#<t>]
  G04 P3.0
  #<k> = [#<k> + 1]
o100 endwhile
N900 G00 X[#<xd>]
N910 M2
%
